Cell["\<\
\[LineSeparator]The horizon (b) has to be shifted by the energy computed in \
the masterscalar notebook (0.5013868846238644`). also, the 20 squared factor \
comes from the normalization factor used some \[LineSeparator]paragraphs down.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930306368289226*^9, 3.93030644639041*^9}, {
